public static <K, V> List<V> addToValueList(Map<K, List<V>> map, K key, V value) {
        List<V> valueList = map.get(key);
        if (valueList == null) {
            valueList = new ArrayList<V>();
            map.put(key, valueList);
        }
        valueList.add(value);

        return valueList;
    }

pseudo_code:
